    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the eerie wilderness in <i>Raccoon Hunter</i>, a chilling horror-hunting experience about a man and his mysterious pet lurking beneath the well. Armed with a double-barreled shotgun and a trusty axe, you must hunt raccoons to keep your pet fed or you might be next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Raccoon Hunter</i> you can..</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt raccoons in the woods to feed your pet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect varying amounts of raccoon meat each day based on your pet\u2019s  hunger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the wild, but beware of wolves and other threats that roam the forest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt birds to restore your health when you're injured.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the story behind the creature in the well and your twisted connection to it.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the eerie wilderness in <i>Raccoon Hunter</i>, a chilling horror-hunting experience about a man and his mysterious pet lurking beneath the well. Armed with a double-barreled shotgun and a trusty axe, you must hunt raccoons to keep your pet fed or you might be next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Raccoon Hunter</i> you can..</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt raccoons in the woods to feed your pet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect varying amounts of raccoon meat each day based on your pet\u2019s  hunger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the wild, but beware of wolves and other threats that roam the forest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt birds to restore your health when you're injured.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the story behind the creature in the well and your twisted connection to it.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
